    "Launch at Login needs your approval in System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“登录时打开”需要你在系统设置中批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave blank to follow the Primary Action automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "留空以自动跟随主要动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左箭头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left-click a Menu Slot to focus it. Use the in-slot Edit button to configure an occupied Slot, double-click an occupied Slot, or right-click for details and actions. Press Return, Space, or Command-E to edit the focused Slot. Actions do not execute in Editor Mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左键点按菜单槽位以聚焦它。使用槽位内的“编辑”按钮或连按已占用的槽位进行配置，右键点按查看详情和操作。按 Return、空格键或 Command-E 编辑聚焦的槽位。编辑模式下动作不会执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left-click a Slot to focus it. Use its Edit button, double-click, or Command-E to configure a Menu Item; press Return or Space after focusing it. Right-click for details and Slot actions. Slot configuration stays attached to the Menu instead of the Library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左键点按槽位以聚焦它。使用其“编辑”按钮、连按或 Command-E 配置菜单项；聚焦后也可按 Return 或空格键。右键点按查看详情和槽位操作。槽位配置保存在菜单中，而不在资源库中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Spinnet intercept the configured Side Button, read selected text, send keyboard actions such as Paste or Cut, move the focused window, and close or quit an App through its own menu for Plugins you allow to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 Spinnet 拦截配置的侧键、读取所选文本、发送粘贴或剪切等键盘操作、移动聚焦的窗口，并为你允许的插件通过 App 自己的菜单关闭或退出该 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Spinnet take screenshots, for its own Capture commands and for Plugins you allow to capture the screen. Spinnet asks for it only when you choose Enable Screen Recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 Spinnet 截屏，用于它自己的截屏命令以及你允许截取屏幕的插件。只有在你选择“启用屏幕录制”时，Spinnet 才会请求此权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the Plugin ask the Host for the current selected text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许插件向宿主请求当前所选的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the Plugin ask the Host to replace the current clipboard text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许插件请求宿主替换当前剪贴板中的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
