      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紫色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and open Spinnet again to use the new language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出并再次打开 Spinnet 以使用新语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and reopen this app bundle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出并重新打开此 App 包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Basic System Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取基本系统状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Clipboard History": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取剪贴板历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Current Clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取当前剪贴板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Reviewed Tools": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取已审核的工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Selected Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取所选文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read aggregate CPU use, memory use, startup disk capacity and internal battery status. No process names, paths or history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 CPU 总使用率、内存使用量、启动磁盘容量和内置电池状态。不读取进程名称、路径或历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read declared Homebrew package, tap, service, Doctor and application-adoption data. Vulnerability checks send installed upstream repository identities and source versions to api.osv.dev; selected-package analytics contacts formulae.brew.sh. Explicit previews may send chosen package and dependency names and recipe versions to ghcr.io for bounded bottle-size metadata. Reads never install, upgrade or change source trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取声明的 Homebrew 软件包、tap、服务、Doctor 和应用程序接管数据。漏洞检查会将已安装软件的上游仓库标识和源代码版本发送到 api.osv.dev；所选软件包的统计信息会联络 formulae.brew.sh。明确的预览可能会将所选软件包和依赖的名称及配方版本发送到 ghcr.io，以获取有限的 bottle 大小元数据。读取操作永远不会安装、升级或更改来源信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read declared data types, including retained entries collected before this grant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取声明的数据类型，包括在此授权之前收集并保留的条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the declared data types from the current clipboard. A Command that reads selected text also uses this grant for a temporary Copy fallback when an app does not expose its selection through Accessibility. Without the grant, it uses Accessibility-only selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从当前剪贴板读取声明的数据类型。当某个 App 不通过辅助功能提供其所选内容时，读取所选文本的命令也会借助此授权临时使用“拷贝”作为后备。没有此授权时，只通过辅助功能读取所选内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the focused window's frame and its screen, move or resize that window, and move it into or out of full screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取聚焦窗口的位置大小及其所在屏幕，移动该窗口或调整其大小，并让它进入或退出全屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the name and bundle identifier of the App in front of Spinnet, and which ways Spinnet would close or quit it. Never a list of your Apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 Spinnet 之前位于前台的 App 的名称和 Bundle 标识符，以及 Spinnet 可以用哪些方式关闭或退出它。永远不会读取你的 App 列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
