    "Spinnet did not load these installed Plugins. Their Menu Items stay in the Menu, unavailable. Install a copy this version can run, or remove them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 没有载入这些已安装的插件。它们的菜单项留在菜单中，但不可用。请安装此版本能运行的副本，或将其移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet is off: the trigger reaches other apps and the Menu does not open. Clipboard History follows its own setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 已关闭：触发键会传给其他 App，菜单不会打开。剪贴板历史遵循其自身设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet keeps each key in your Keychain and adds it to requests itself; the Plugin never reads it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 把每个密钥保存在你的钥匙串中，并自行将其加入请求；插件永远无法读取它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet keeps this key in your Keychain and adds it to requests itself; the Plugin never reads it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 把此密钥保存在你的钥匙串中，并自行将其加入请求；插件永远无法读取它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet will retain text, URLs, images, rich text, file references, and embedded binary content on this Mac. Source application and copy time are recorded, but not window or document titles. Finder files are not cloned. Default retention is 24 hours. Passwords, Keychain Access, excluded applications, and concealed or transient items are skipped. Plugins need separate type-scoped access, including to entries retained before their grant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 会在此 Mac 上保留文本、URL、图像、富文本、文件引用和嵌入的二进制内容。会记录来源应用程序和拷贝时间，但不记录窗口或文稿标题。不会克隆访达中的文件。默认保留 24 小时。会跳过密码、钥匙串访问、排除的应用程序以及隐藏或临时的项目。插件需要单独的按类型访问权限，包括访问授权之前保留的条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet's Application Support folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 的 Application Support 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spinnet's own text. Plugins show their text as they provide it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 自身的文字。插件的文字按插件提供的原样显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start %@ to use its Commands": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动 %@ 以使用其命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start %@, then connect to check Automation permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动 %@，然后连接以检查自动化权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still needed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍需填写：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored Data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储的数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored Data: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储的数据：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored only on this Mac. Spinnet does not sync history through iCloud or Plugins. Large content is saved locally; Plugins read it in authorized chunks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只存储在此 Mac 上。Spinnet 不会通过 iCloud 或插件同步历史。大型内容存储在本地；插件按授权分块读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streams the Host's and its helpers' logs in Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在终端中输出宿主及其辅助程序的日志流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Supports parameters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持参数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Permissions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Menu Item in Slot %lld uses it; it stays in the Menu and is marked unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "槽位 %lld 中的菜单项使用了它；该菜单项留在菜单中并标记为不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Menu Items in Slots %@ use it; they stay in the Menu and are marked unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "槽位 %@ 中的菜单项使用了它；这些菜单项留在菜单中并标记为不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Menu opens with your trigger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的触发方式打开菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Plugin for this Slot is unavailable, so its Actions cannot be changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此槽位的插件不可用，因此无法更改其动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app path, version and every loaded Plugin, for an acceptance report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 路径、版本和每个已载入的插件，用于验收报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current Menu Item and its Actions will be replaced by the selected Preset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前菜单项及其动作将被所选预设替换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last check did not complete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次检查未完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The previously selected %@ is unavailable. Choose a replacement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之前选择的%@不可用。请选择替代项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected Actions do not require configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选动作不需要配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected Preset is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选预设不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This External App operation is not supported by Spinnet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spinnet 不支持此外部 App 操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Plugin changed or is unavailable. Close and reopen Plugin Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此插件已更改或不可用。请关闭并重新打开插件设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Plugin does not provide another Action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此插件不提供其他动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Preset is unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Preset requires setup before it can be added": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设需要设置后才能添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone. Collection and Plugin grants do not change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。收集设置和插件授权不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This development build does not check automatically. Use Check Now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此开发版本不会自动检查。请使用“立即检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder is missing or cannot be written. Choose another to save screenshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹缺失或无法写入。请选择其他文件夹来存储截屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key combination is not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此按键组合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the whole Slot from the Menu. You can undo the deletion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从菜单中移除整个槽位。你可以撤销删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a different search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请尝试其他搜索词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off and Delete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭并删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off and Retain": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭并保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off Clipboard History?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭剪贴板历史？"
          }
        }
